
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3002
@date = 2026-11-27
@bookingId = 1

# Execute individualmente.
# PATCH e DELETE alteram o registro #1.
# Para recuperar as fixtures: npm run db:seed



# Registro da minha rodada de testes e respectivos responses.
# As requisições foram executadas individualmente e os retornos foram conferidos.

### 1. Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Listar todas as salas
GET http://localhost:3002/api/rooms

### 2. Listar salas
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms

### 3. Listar salas com filtros
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms?buildingId=1&type=LAB&minCapacity=20&active=true&name=Laboratório

### 4. Consultar utilização do prédio
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/buildings/1/usage?date={{date}}

### 5. Consultar utilização de prédio sem salas ativas
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/buildings/3/usage?date={{date}}

### 6. Criar reserva
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roomId": 3,
  "userId": 15,
  "startAt": "{{date}}T13:00:00-03:00",
  "endAt": "{{date}}T14:00:00-03:00",
  "purpose": "Projeto integrador"
}

### 7. Atualizar reserva
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/bookings/{{bookingId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "purpose": "Reunião revisada"
}

### 8. Erro de validação: PATCH vazio
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/bookings/{{bookingId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 9. Erro de validação: userId não permitido no PATCH
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/bookings/{{bookingId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 2
}

### 10. Erro de validação: purpose vazio
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/bookings/{{bookingId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "purpose": "   "
}

### 11. Erro de validação: purpose acima de 200 caracteres
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/bookings/{{bookingId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "purpose": "baninhabaninhabaninhabaninhabaninhabaninhabaninhabaninhabaninhabaninhabaninhabaninhabaninhabaninhabaninhabaninhabaninhabaninhabaninhabaninhabaninhabaninhabaninhabaninhabaninhabaninhabaninhabaninhabaninhabaninhabaninhabaninha"
}

### 12. Excluir reserva
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/bookings/{{bookingId}}



### POST - Impedir reservas com horários sobrepostos na mesma sala
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 15,
  "roomId": 1,
  "startAt": "2026-11-27T09:00:00-03:00",
  "endAt": "2026-11-27T10:00:00-03:00",
  "purpose": "Teste de conflito"
}


### POST - Impedir reservas sobrepostas do mesmo usuário em salas diferentes
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 1,
  "roomId": 3,
  "startAt": "2026-11-27T09:00:00-03:00",
  "endAt": "2026-11-27T10:00:00-03:00",
  "purpose": "Teste de conflito do usuário"
}


